questions.stem_md:
For $f(x) = x^4 - 8x^3 + 22x^2 - 24x + 7$:

(a) find the intervals on which $f$ is strictly increasing and strictly decreasing;

(b) find the local maximum and local minimum values.

For $f(x) = 2x^3 - 15x^2 + 36x + 1$ on the closed interval $[1, 5]$:

(a) find the local maximum and local minimum values of $f$;

(b) find the absolute maximum and absolute minimum values of $f$ on $[1, 5]$.
